v 3
d lpddd: stacked local-projection triple differences with a seasonal base period
d
d lpddd estimates the dynamic effect of a treatment that starts at different
d dates for different groups and affects only some units within a treated
d group. It stacks each treated cohort with clean control groups, runs one
d regression per period relative to treatment (local projections) and takes a
d triple difference (treated group x eligible unit). With season() each period
d is compared with the same season before treatment. With spans() effects are
d estimated for spans of periods. A difference-in-differences is available
d with the option dd.
d
d Requires: Stata version 15.1. Uses reghdfe (SSC) if it is installed.
d
d KW: local projections
d KW: triple difference
d KW: difference-in-differences
d KW: stacked regression
d KW: event study
d KW: seasonality
